dagre.min.js is vendored verbatim from dagre v0.8.5's dist/dagre.min.js
(https://github.com/dagrejs/dagre), the full self-contained bundle: its
`lodash` and `graphlib` dependencies are compiled in, so `dagre.graphlib.Graph`
is available with no other script loaded first. It has no DOM or rendering
code of its own -- only layout. (`dist/dagre.core.min.js` is *not* used here:
despite the name, it omits `graphlib` and expects it as a separately-loaded
global, which this project has no other reason to carry.) Fetched from
https://registry.npmjs.org/dagre/-/dagre-0.8.5.tgz.

